X9 NormalTextRun SCXW66461274\">\n      \"\n    </span>\n   </em>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW66461274\">\n    ,\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW66461274\">\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW66461274\">\n    David\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW66461274 SpellingErrorV2Themed\">\n    Jeanmotte\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW66461274\">\n    , Ophélie Fontana\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW66461274\">\n    et\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW66461274\">\n   <strong>\n    Walid\n   </strong>\n   , deux équipes survoltées, ont rivalisé dans des épreuves hilarantes pour\n   <strong>\n    décrocher la victoire et offrir un cadeau\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW66461274\">\n    à leur\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW66461274\">\n    public.\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW254215585 TextRun\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254215585\">\n   Revivez les moments les plus drôles de l’émission culte avec notre\n   <strong>\n    bêtisier spécial\n   </strong>\n   <em>\n    <strong>\n     \" Le Grand Cactus \"\n    </strong>\n   </em>\n   . Le meilleur des pires personnages de\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254215585 SpellingErrorV2Themed\">\n    Kody\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254215585\">\n    , James\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254215585 SpellingErrorV2Themed\">\n    Deano\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254215585\">\n    , Tamara Payne, Isabelle\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254215585 SpellingErrorV2Themed\">\n    Hauben\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254215585\">\n   <strong>\n    ou de Martin Charlier\n   </strong>\n   , alias Kiki l’Innocent, ou encore les moments de solitude de\n   <strong>\n    Jérôme de\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254215585 SpellingErrorV2Themed\">\n    Warzée\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254215585\">\n   .\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW254215585 TextRun\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254215585\">\n   <strong>\n    Crise de rire et humour 100% belge garanti !\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n <strong style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW94208276\">\n   Pour vivre ou revivre\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW94208276\">\n   la joie de cette compétition festive\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW94208276\">\n   , retrouvez\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW94208276\">\n   -\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW94208276\">\n   la\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW94208276\">\n   </span>\n   en replay sur\n  </span>\n  <a href=\"https://auvio.rtbf.be/media/le-super-betisier-le-super-betisier-3137274\" target=\"_blank\">\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW94208276 SpellingErrorV2Themed\">\n    Auvio\n   </span>\n  </a>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW94208276\">\n   .\n  </span>\n </strong>\n</p>\n\n', '2303cf5d95470b60f2c1dc210cb5bb6e.jpg', 4),
(5170, 2501, '2023-12-27', 1, 'Alors que le cerveau veut dire quelque chose mais que la bouche ne suit pas, c\'est une pluie de lapsus qui s\'abat sur les émissi', 'C\n  \n\n   e\n   \n    2\n   \n\n\n\n    7\n   \n\n     décembre à 20h20\n   \n\n    sur la Une\n   \n\n\n   ,\n  \n\n\n\n     \" \n    \n\n     Le Super Bêtisier sort le grand jeu !\n    \n\n     \"\n    \n\n\n\n\n\n   a résonné de rires\n  \n\n   et de bonne humeur\n  \n\n   .\n  \n\n   Le programme propose à la fois\n  \n\n\n    un\n   \n\n    quiz sur la\n   \n\n\n\n    culture télé et des bêtisiers\n   \n   plus drôles les uns que les autres.\n  \n\n   Animée par la pétillante\n   \n    Sara\n   \n\n\n\n    D\n   \n\n    e\n   \n\n    Paduwa\n   \n\n\n   , cette compétition\n  \n\n   hors du commun\n  \n\n   a vu s’affronter deux trios dynamiques :\n   \n    Livia\n   \n\n\n\n    Dushkoff\n   \n\n    , Gérald\n   \n\n    Watelet\n   \n\n    et\n   \n\n    Cathy\n   \n\n    Immelen\n   \n\n\n   d’un\n  \n\n   e\n  \n\n\n\n   part\n  \n\n   , et\n   \n    David\n   \n\n\n\n    Jeanmotte\n   \n\n    , Ophélie Fontana\n   \n\n    et\n   \n\n\n\n    Walid\n   \n   de l’autre.\n  \n\n   Lors de défis\n  \n\n   délirant\n  \n\n   s\n  \n\n   , ils devaient remporter la victoire e\n  \n\n   n vue d’\n  \n\n   offrir\n   \n    un cadeau\n   \n\n\n\n    incroyable\n   \n\n\n\n    à leur\n   \n\n\n\n    public\n   \n   .', '/article/alors-que-le-cerveau-veut-dire-quelque-chose-mais-que-la-bouche-ne-suit-pas-c-est-une-pluie-de-lapsus-qui-s-abat-sur-le', 101, '<p>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW43798439 TextRun\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   C\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   e\n   <strong>\n    2\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    7\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n     décembre à 20h20\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    sur la Une\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   ,\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <em>\n    <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n     \" \n    </span>\n    <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n     Le Super Bêtisier sort le grand jeu !\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n     \"\n    </span>\n   </em>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   a résonné de rires\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   et de bonne humeur\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   .\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   Le programme propose à la fois\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    un\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    quiz sur la\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   <strong>\n    culture télé et des bêtisiers\n   </strong>\n   plus drôles les uns que les autres.\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   Animée par la pétillante\n   <strong>\n    Sara\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    D\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    e\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    Paduwa\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   , cette compétition\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   hors du commun\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   a vu s’affronter deux trios dynamiques :\n   <strong>\n    Livia\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    Dushkoff\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    , Gérald\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    Watelet\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    et\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    Cathy\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    Immelen\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   d’un\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   e\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   part\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   , et\n   <strong>\n    David\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    Jeanmotte\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    , Ophélie Fontana\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    et\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   <strong>\n    Walid\n   </strong>\n   de l’autre.\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   Lors de défis\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   délirant\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   s\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   , ils devaient remporter la victoire e\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   n vue d’\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   offrir\n   <strong>\n    un cadeau\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    incroyable\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n    à leur\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW43798439\">\n   <strong>\n    public\n   </strong>\n   .\n  </span>\n </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW254579288 TextRun\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW254579288\">\n   <strong>\n    <em>\n     \" Les meilleurs… et les pires lapsus \"\n    </em>\n   </strong>\n   , plus mythiques les uns que les autres,\n   <strong>\n    ces petites fautes de langages que l’on commet tous, sont encore plus drôles lorsqu’elles sortent de la bouche de nos animateurs préférés\n   </strong>\n   . À revoir, sans modération !\n  </span>\n </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n <strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115933525\">\n   Vivez ou revivez les éclats de rire et\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115933525\">\n   l’euphorie de cette soirée unique en replay\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115933525\">\n   sur\n   <a href=\"https://auvio.rtbf.be/media/le-super-betisier-le-super-betisier-3137274\" target=\"_blank\">\n    Auvio\n   </a>\n   .\n  </span>\n </strong>\n</p>\n\n', 'fa3b3308299e6eb53c87501b4df72dc8.jpg', 7),
(5171, 2502, '2023-12-27', 8, 'Carl Hoefkens tire un premier bilan avant la trêve hivernale : \"On a eu des moments extraordinaires mais le niveau général doit ', 'Le Standard a évité le pire en arrachant\n \n\n   un point\n  \n\n au bout du suspense face à Saint-Trond.', '/article/carl-hoefkens-tire-un-premier-bilan-avant-la-treve-hivernale-on-a-eu-des-moments-extraordinaires-mais-le-niveau-general', 143, '<p>\n Le Standard a évité le pire en arrachant\n <a href=\"https://www.rtbf.be/article/direct-audio-et-commente-standard-saint-trond-0-1-fujita-ouvre-le-score-a-cinq-minutes-du-terme-11305744\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <strong>\n   un point\n  </strong>\n </a>\n au bout du suspense face à Saint-Trond.\n</p>\n\n<p>\n S’il n’est pas pleinement satisfait du résultat,\n <strong>\n  Carl Hoefkens\n </strong>\n souligne l’attitude de ses troupes. \"\n <em>\n  C’est bien parce qu’on a continué à se battre, ce n’était pas évident en encaissant cinq minutes avant. On aurait pu penser que c’était fini mais on est resté combatif, c’est le plus important ce mercredi. Ce n’était pas un match facile, les deux équipes ont le même niveau. C’était un match fermé\n </em>\n \".\n</p>\n\n<p>\n Pour l’entraîneur du Standard, le résultat est logique. \"\n <em>\n  C’était 50-50. Ils n’ont pas eu beaucoup d’occasions mais c’est un point mérité car on a montré une bonne mentalité\".\n </em>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n Après 23 points en vingt matches, le T1 rouche tire un premier bilan. \"\n <em>\n  On a eu des moments extraordinaires mais le niveau général doit augmenter. A la maison contre des équipes comme Saint-Trond, on doit être capable de gagner. Même si ce n’est pas facile, ça doit être l’objectif. On doit grandir comme groupe et comme club\".\n </em>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n L’ancien coach de Bruges est déjà tourné vers 2024 et attend du renfort cet hiver.\n <em>\n  \"On a besoin de qualité et de joueurs qui peuvent faire la différence. La mentalité est bonne. J’espère qu’on pourra faire des transferts, j’ai vu que\n  <a href=\"https://www.rtbf.be/article/le-standard-voit-son-interdiction-de-transferts-levee-par-la-commission-des-licences-11306002\" target=\"_blank\">\n   <strong>\n    l’interdiction est levée\n   </strong>\n  </a>\n  . On a de jeunes joueurs avec beaucoup de qualité mais il faut aussi avoir des gars avec du métier. Si on a ça, on pourra faire de belles choses dans le futur\n </em>\n \".\n</p>\n\n', NULL, 4),
(5172, 2503, '2023-12-27', 3, 'Les gosses mettent la pagaille et c\'est un florilège de mignonneries', 'C’\n  \n\n   est\n  \n\n   un festival de rires orchestré par\n   \n    Sara\n   \n\n\n\n    D\n   \n\n    e\n   \n\n    Paduwa\n   \n\n\n   ,\n  \n\n\n\n   c\n  \n\n   e\n   \n    2\n   \n\n\n\n    7\n   \n\n     décembre à 20h20\n   \n\n    sur la Une\n   \n\n\n   ,\n  \n\n   avec\n  \n\n\n\n     \" \n    \n\n     Le Super Bêtisier sort le grand jeu !\n    \n\n     \"\n    \n\n\n\n   .', '/article/les-gosses-mettent-la-pagaille-et-c-est-un-florilege-de-mignonneries-11301491', 101, '<p>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW115963617 TextRun\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   C’\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   est\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   un festival de rires orchestré par\n   <strong>\n    Sara\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    D\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    e\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    Paduwa\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   ,\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   c\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   e\n   <strong>\n    2\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    7\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n     décembre à 20h20\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    sur la Une\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   ,\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   avec\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <em>\n    <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n     \" \n    </span>\n    <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n     Le Super Bêtisier sort le grand jeu !\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n     \"\n    </span>\n   </em>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   .\n  </span>\n </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW115963617 TextRun\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   Dans cette\n   <strong>\n    émission qui mélange quiz et bêtisier\n   </strong>\n   , n\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   os d\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   eux trios\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   dynamiques\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   d\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   e personnalités de la té\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   lé\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   ,\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   avec\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    Livia\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    Dushkoff\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    , Gérald\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    Watelet\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    et\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    Cathy\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    Immelen\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   dans la première équipe\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   , et\n   <strong>\n    David\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    Jeanmotte\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    , Ophélie Fontana\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    et\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n    Walid\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   dans la seconde\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   ,\n   <strong>\n    se sont affrontés dans une compétition délirante\n   </strong>\n   .\n  </span>\n </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW115963617 TextRun\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   <strong>\n    L’objectif ?\n   </strong>\n   Remporter la victoire et\n   <strong>\n    offrir un cadeau au public\n   </strong>\n   .\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   Et l’enjeu est de taille. Il y a de quoi\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   gâter\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   ceux qui sont venus assister à l’émission.\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW115963617\">\n   <strong>\n    Chaque personne gagnante repart avec un séjour à l’hôtel !\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW234082069 TextRun\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW234082069\">\n   Nos petites têtes blondes n’ont pas fini de nous faire rire, avec\n   <strong>\n    le bêtisier\n    <em>\n     \" Enfants hors de contrôle \"\n    </em>\n   </strong>\n   , revivez\n   <strong>\n    les meilleures vidéos extraites du net et de programmes de la RTBF\n   </strong>\n   tels que\n   <strong>\n    \" The Voice Kids \"\n   </strong>\n   ou encore\n   <strong>\n    \" Les ambassadeurs \"\n   </strong>\n   .\n  </span>\n </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n <strong style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW110820765\">\n   Vivez ou r\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW110820765\">\n   e\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW110820765\">\n   vivez\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW110820765\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW110820765\">\n   l\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW110820765\">\n   es moments\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW110820765\">\n   d’anthologie\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW110820765\">\n   de cette soirée inoubliable\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW110820765\">\n   <span style=\"display:none\">\n    \n   </span>\n   en replay sur\n   <a href=\"https://auvio.rtbf.be/media/le-super-betisier-le-super-betisier-3137274\" target=\"_blank\">\n    Auvio\n   </a>\n   .\n  </span>\n </strong>\n <span class=\"BCX9 EOP SCXW110820765\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  \n </span>\n <span style=\"display:none\">\n  \n </span>\n</p>\n\n', '5dc7e9751b9119acfe05118b934c2fb5.jpg', 5),
(5173, 2504, '2023-12-27', 4, 'Quand le fou rire surgit en émission, il devient contagieux aussi pour ceux qui regardent', 'Sara\n   \n\n    D\n   \n\n    e\n   \n\n    Paduwa\n   \n\n\n   a pris les commandes d’une\n   \n    soirée exceptionnelle le 2\n   \n\n\n\n    7\n   \n\n     décembre à 20h20\n   \n\n    sur la Une\n   \n\n\n   avec\n  \n\n\n\n     \" \n    \n\n     Le Super Bêtisier sort le grand jeu !\n    \n\n     \"\n    \n\n\n\n   .\n  \n\n   Le principe est simple\n  \n\n    : offrir\n   \n    une soirée mémorable alliant bêtisier de fin d’année et quiz sur la télévision\n   \n   . Pour se faire,\n  \n\n\n\n   d\n  \n\n   eux trios décalés,\n   \n    Livia\n   \n\n\n\n    Dushkoff\n   \n\n    , Gérald\n   \n\n    Watelet\n   \n\n    et\n   \n\n    Cathy\n   \n\n    Immelen\n   \n\n    , et David\n   \n\n    Jeanmotte\n   \n\n    , Ophélie Fontana\n   \n\n    et\n   \n\n\n\n    Walid\n   \n   , ont relevé des défis hilarants pour décrocher la victoire et\n  \n\n\n    offrir un merveilleux cadeau \n   \n\n    le\n   \n\n    ur\n   \n\n    public.', '/article/quand-le-fou-rire-surgit-en-emission-il-devient-contagieux-aussi-pour-ceux-qui-regardent-11301504', 101, '<p>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW257998386 TextRun\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    Sara\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    D\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    e\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    Paduwa\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n   a pris les commandes d’une\n   <strong>\n    soirée exceptionnelle le 2\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    7\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n     décembre à 20h20\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    sur la Une\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n   avec\n  </span>\n  <em>\n   <strong>\n    <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n     \" \n    </span>\n    <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n     Le Super Bêtisier sort le grand jeu !\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n     \"\n    </span>\n   </strong>\n  </em>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n   .\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n   Le principe est simple\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    : offrir\n   <strong>\n    une soirée mémorable alliant bêtisier de fin d’année et quiz sur la télévision\n   </strong>\n   . Pour se faire,\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n   d\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n   eux trios décalés,\n   <strong>\n    Livia\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    Dushkoff\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    , Gérald\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    Watelet\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    et\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    Cathy\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    Immelen\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    , et David\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    Jeanmotte\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    , Ophélie Fontana\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    et\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n   <strong>\n    Walid\n   </strong>\n   , ont relevé des défis hilarants pour décrocher la victoire et\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    offrir un merveilleux cadeau \n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    le\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    ur\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW257998386\">\n    public.\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW152352669 TextRun\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n   Place à l’humour avec\n   <strong>\n    le bêtisier\n   </strong>\n   <em>\n    <strong>\n     \" Fous rires en série \"\n    </strong>\n   </em>\n   , du\n   <em>\n    \" 6-8 \"\n   </em>\n   \n   <em>\n    \" Les Enfants de Chœur \"\n   </em>\n   en passant par\n   <em>\n    \" On n’est pas des pigeons ! \"\n   </em>\n   ,\n   <strong>\n    Sara\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n    D\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n    e\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n    Paduwa\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n    , Fanny\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n    Jandrain\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n    , Tamara Payne, Cyril\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n    Detaeye\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n    , Raphaël\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n    Scaïni\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW152352669\">\n   <strong>\n    et bien d’autres nous ont fait mourir de rire\n   </strong>\n   et on ne se lasse pas de revoir ces moments déjà culte.\n  </span>\n </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n <strong style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   Rires assurés,\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   pour\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   viv\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   re\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   ou\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   reviv\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   re\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   ces instants comiques\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   et partagez la joie de cette compétition déjantée\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   , retr\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   ouvez-la\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW80543306\">\n   <span style=\"display:none\">\n    \n   </span>\n   en replay sur\n   <a href=\"https://auvio.rtbf.be/media/le-super-betisier-le-super-betisier-3137274\" target=\"_blank\">\n    Auvio\n   </a>\n   .\n  </span>\n </strong>\n <span class=\"BCX9 EOP SCXW80543306\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  \n </span>\n <span style=\"display:none\">\n  \n </span>\n</p>\n\n', '3b5d06d505b0aee515477ef0826f5594.jpg', 6),
(5174, 2505, '2023-12-27', 2, 'Devinez la suite de la vidéo du Super Bêtisier sort le grand jeu', 'Sous la direction énergique de\n   \n    Sara\n   \n\n\n\n    D\n   \n\n    e\n   \n\n    Paduwa\n   \n\n\n   , le 2\n  \n\n   7\n  \n\n    décembre à 20h20\n  \n\n   sur la Une\n  \n\n   ,\n  \n\n\n\n     \" \n    \n\n     Le Super Bêtisier sort le grand jeu !\n    \n\n     \"\n    \n\n\n\n\n\n   met le feu \n  \n\n    nos écrans.\n  \n\n\n    Dans ce concept alliant\n   \n\n\n\n    quiz et bêtisier\n   \n   ,\n  \n\n\n\n   d\n  \n\n   eux trios survoltés, composés de\n   \n    Livia\n   \n\n\n\n    Dushkoff\n   \n\n    , Gérald\n   \n\n    Watelet\n   \n\n    et\n   \n\n    Cathy\n   \n\n    Immelen\n   \n\n\n   , et de\n   \n    David\n   \n\n\n\n    Jeanm\n   \n\n    otte\n   \n\n    , Oph\n   \n\n    élie Fontana\n   \n\n    et\n   \n\n\n\n    Walid\n   \n   de l’autre,\n   \n    ont rivalisé\n   \n   dans des épreuves hilarantes\n   \n    pour décrocher la victoire et offrir un cadeau\n   \n\n\n\n    d’exception\n   \n\n\n\n    à leur\n   \n\n\n\n    public.', '/article/devinez-la-suite-de-la-video-du-super-betisier-sort-le-grand-jeu-11301488', 101, '<p>\n <span class=\"BCX9 SCXW27047982 TextRun\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW27047982\">\n   Sous la direction énergique de\n   <strong>\n    Sara\n   </strong>\n  </span>\n  <strong>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW27047982\">\n    D\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW27047982\">\n    e\n   </span>\n   <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW27047982\">\n    Paduwa\n   </span>\n  </strong>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW27047982\">\n   , le 2\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW27047982\">\n   7\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW27047982\">\n    décembre à 20h20\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW27047982\">\n   sur la Une\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"BCX9 NormalTextRun SCXW27047982\">\n   ,\n  </spa